05051,"name":"Régine Mondion","role":"Denise","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yZQcslJ4cNR8Xr1IY1FNrJO408.jpg"},{"id":3086895,"name":"Marie Papillon","role":"Jeanne, Rose's roommate","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u20pG0FH8UFeOp3Q66mbRN3wr6v.jpg"},{"id":1383904,"name":"Françoise Remont","role":"80 year old woman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jfkyzq13ZNtIENMivx5wJX0pxBa.jpg"},{"id":3219136,"name":"David Baranes","role":"Police officer"},{"id":1175845,"name":"Rodolphe Saulnier","role":"Paramedic","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oVTVmRBPLreHPg92fVUDaRXotXG.jpg"},{"id":1677333,"name":"Audrey Quoturi","role":"A patient's daughter (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yxUx08s5Z5GnsDgZD332TuthdpI.jpg"},{"id":238398,"name":"Lucía Sánchez","role":"Ms. Dos Santos","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gX1g80dnDgO5wR0fYzyCvMZKY2Y.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Chiamate un dottore!","overview":"La vigilia di Natale, i parigini più fortunati stanno trascorrendo la serata con la famiglia a scartare i regali. Altri, invece, sono a casa da soli a guardare la televisione mentre altri ancora come Serge lavorano. Dottore di turno al pronto soccorso, Serge ha dovuto accettare di prestare servizio: del resto, non può prendersi troppe libertà dal momento che rischia di essere radiato per via dei troppi errori commessi. Mentre le visite si susseguono, Serge incontra un paio di volte Malek, fattorino che consegna cibo, anch'egli in servizio. Complice un malessere, Serge chiederà a Malek di prendere il suo posto."},{"language":"en-US","title":"A Good Doctor","overview":"On Christmas eve, Serge is the only on-call emergency doctor available. Struck by a crippling back-ache, he gets help from a pizza delivery boy who will need to step in the doctor's shoes."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"C'est le soir de Noël. Les Parisiens les plus chanceux se préparent à déballer leurs cadeaux en famille. D'autres regardent la télévision seuls chez eux. D'autres encore, comme Serge, travaillent. Serge est le seul SOS-Médecin de garde ce soir-là. Ses collègues se sont tous défilés. De toute façon il n'a plus son mot à dire car il a pris trop de libertés avec l'exercice de la médecine, et la radiation lui pend au nez. Les visites s'enchaînent et Serge essaye de suivre le rythme, de mauvaise grâce, quand tombe l'adresse de sa prochaine consultation. C'est celle de Rose, une relation de famille, qui l'appelle à l'aide. Il arrive sur les lieux en même temps qu'un livreur Uber Eats, Malek, lui aussi de service ce soir-là..."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AbEVYKDKuOBIzXk2ecucq0LFiVo.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/70zanWt7TxBCZJCdMYhCMFDdGQr.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":613349,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AbEVYKDKuOBIzXk2ecucq0LFiVo.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AbEVYKDKuOBIzXk2ecucq0LFiVo.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AbEVYKDKuOBIzXk2ecucq0LFiVo.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AbEVYKDKuOBIzXk2ecucq0LFiVo.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7wx7VMj4eoJUXR4ZVdYVDzFStNd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7wx7VMj4eoJUXR4ZVdYVDzFStNd.jpg","language":"en","width":1485,"height":2227},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7wx7VMj4eoJUXR4ZVdYVDzFStNd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7wx7VMj4eoJUXR4ZVdYVDzFStNd.jpg